        "description": "StoryGrid is a sleek, minimal, and modern WordPress blog theme built for storytellers. Perfect for writers, travelers, and lifestyle bloggers, it provides a distraction-free space where your words take center stage. With clean design, elegant typography, and an easy setup process, StoryGrid allows you to focus entirely on your content. No coding required — just install, write, and engage with your audience."
